sequenceDiagram
    %% Interaction_Trace.mmd
    %% End-to-end user transaction trace via the BFF boundary.
    %% Component.razor → Resilient Typed HttpClient → BFF Cookie Verification
    %% → Minimal API Feature Handler → Table Storage Execution.

    autonumber
    actor User as Player (mobile)
    participant Page as Game Page<br/>(Component.razor)
    participant Http as Resilient Typed<br/>HttpClient (.AddStandardResilienceHandler)
    participant Cookie as DevCookie<br/>HttpOnly · SameSite=Strict
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware<br/>+ Microsoft OIDC (prod)
    participant API as Minimal API<br/>Feature Handler (MapGroup)
    participant Repo as Slice Repository<br/>(e.g., PoRacer.Storage)
    participant Table as Azure Table Storage<br/>(Azurite in Dev)
    participant TLogs as OpenTelemetry<br/>App Insights
    participant Logs as Serilog<br/>(source-gen events)

    User->>Page: Tap "Submit score"
    Page->>Page: Optimistic UI update<br/>(local toast)
    Page->>Http: POST /api/poracer/scores<br/>{totalTimeSeconds, finalPosition}
    Note over Http: Standard resilience:<br/>retry x3 + exponential backoff<br/>+ circuit breaker
    Http->>Cookie: Attach Bearer/DevCookie<br/>(read from browser jar)
    Http->>+Auth: HTTP request hits host
    Auth->>Auth: Authorize attribute check
    alt Authenticated
        Auth-->>API: 200 OK to /api/poracer/scores
        API->>API: Bind PoRacerScoreDto<br/>(System.Text.Json)
        API->>API: Handler validation<br/>(TotalTimeSeconds 1..3600,<br/>FinalPosition 1..8)
        alt validation fails
            API-->>Http: 400 ValidationProblem(errors)
            Http-->>Page: Validation problem (per-field)
            Page-->>User: Inline form errors
        else valid
            API->>API: Coerce PlayerDisplayName<br/>from auth claims (anti-spoof)
            API->>API: Cooldown check<br/>(_lastSubmitByUser, ≥30 s)
            API->>+Repo: SaveHighScoreAsync(dto, userId)
            Repo->>+Table: Upsert TableEntity<br/>(PK=poracer, RK=SHA-256(dto))
            Table-->>Repo: 204 / ETag
            Repo-->>-API: Upsert result
            API-->>-Http: 204 NoContent
            Http-->>-Page: 204
            Page->>Page: Update local state + leaderboard cache
            Page-->>User: "Score saved" toast
        end
    else Unauthenticated
        Auth-->>Http: 401 Unauthorized
        Http-->>Page: 401
        Page->>Auth: GET /api/auth/handshake
        Auth-->>Page: AuthState { anonymous, oauthConfigured }
        Page-->>User: Render <LoginScreen />
    end
    Note over Logs,TLogs: Every step emits<br/>source-gen LoggerMessage event<br/>and an OTel span
    API->>Logs: emit "Score accepted" event
    API->>TLogs: trace "poracer.submit"
    Auth->>TLogs: dependency "aztables.upsert"
    Auth->>Logs: emit "Auth challenge" if anon
